    description: "In cluster-autoscaler, 57% of nodes are vendored SDK code classified as tier-1. Fix: add SDK naming patterns to EXTERNAL_DEP_PATTERNS. Source: bakeoff cohort #21."  # c955
    fields:  # c955
      statement: "Vendored Go SDKs in *-sdk-go/ and vendor-internal/ paths must be classified as external dependencies (tier-3), not first-party code (tier-1)"  # c955
      root_cause: "EXTERNAL_DEP_PATTERNS in supply_chain.py only detects standard vendor/ directory, not SDK-naming-convention paths like ionos-cloud-sdk-go/, huaweicloud-sdk-go-v3/, vendor-internal/"  # c955
